00:05:28.560 --> 00:05:32.120
the start and then let it compound. Now,

00:05:30.800 --> 00:05:33.919
here's where most people get this

00:05:32.120 --> 00:05:36.200
completely wrong. They think getting

00:05:33.919 --> 00:05:38.360
views on YouTube is about creating

00:05:36.200 --> 00:05:40.400
