00:05:59.880 --> 00:06:04.040
walking right past you who are already

00:06:02.200 --> 00:06:05.560
hungry. So, the foot traffic is the

00:06:04.040 --> 00:06:07.920
strategy. But, most creators, they're

00:06:05.560 --> 00:06:10.000
opening a five-star buffet in the middle

00:06:07.920 --> 00:06:12.560
of the desert. Beautiful setup, amazing

00:06:10.000 --> 00:06:14.360
