00:06:26.880 --> 00:06:30.800
massive audience wanting this content.

00:06:28.919 --> 00:06:32.280
And he just happened to unknowingly make

00:06:30.800 --> 00:06:33.720
content that a lot of people are looking

00:06:32.280 --> 00:06:35.800
for. So, I didn't invent the

00:06:33.720 --> 00:06:37.880
